{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_9_level_main_09-04_beg","groupId":"main_9","stageId":"main_09-04","title":"臨界值","storyCode":"9-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_09-04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"c4d797586bacc9754c09c316fe1236bed296167df22952b723bca6cb17b67d1b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"narration","text":"4:23 P.M. 天氣/多雲轉陰\n麥克馬丁兄弟炸薯條專門店，二樓"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是沒有回覆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。從昨天到今天，沒有收到任何倫蒂尼姆來的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二十多個小時過去了，他們一定已經收到了我的上一封電訊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"會不會是加密線路有問題？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"不好說啊長官。老實說，自畢業以後，我調來小丘郡都快十年了，需要啟動這條秘密通訊線路的情報就沒幾條。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"前年年末我跟我們小組長彙報，他問我除了第幾個孩子出生以外還有沒有話要說，沒有的話連常規報告都可以省了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，怪不得你開了這家炸薯條店。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"這主意不錯吧？誰讓我的代號一直是廚子呢。當時我就想，就算有外人想找我們的聯絡站，也只會懷疑隔壁書店。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔，而且炸薯條味道很好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"是吧？哈哈，你們隨便吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"小丘郡的馬鈴薯品質就是好。當地人很喜歡我的薯條，要不是還記著自己的點燈人老本行，我早就開了五六家分店。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，總之，昨天你們用暗號找上門的時候，我還以為是又做夢夢到受訓時的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......看起來這條線路是很可能被廢棄了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又或者，有人收到了消息，卻不想給回覆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，你的意思是有人有意攔截我們的情報？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還不好說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下面這條訊息還是原樣發出去——對了，除了三角鐵的發現，再加上我和漢密爾頓上校的對話結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上校針對部分居民的措施已有過激嫌疑。萬不得已的情況下，我希望我們小隊能獲得更多機動權。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"這......看來我沒必要勸你們動用駐軍信使了，是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，隊長，我不想說這個，可我們人有點少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這聽起來真不像你說出來的話。不過放心，沒人想走到那一步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......這座城市的情況，遠比我們來之前預料的更複雜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"廚子，你在小丘郡待了這麼多年，你覺得這裡的人怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼特殊的。你真讓一個塔拉人站我跟前，我也不覺得他和其他地方來的維多利亞人有什麼區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"再說句大實話，要是日子過得不錯，誰會整天想著鬧事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"把理想掛在嘴邊的人挺多，真裝在心裡的走到哪都是少數。更多人在意的不過是填肚子，肚子滿了的話還有錢包。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說的是呀！隊長，我也很難把達米安·巴里和鬼魂部隊扯上關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我眼裡，他和那條街上的居民都是普通人，被抓的時候會嚇得立刻求饒，親人死了會聚在一起崩潰哭泣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們一點都不像受過訓練的士兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們說的，正是我所擔心的——漢密爾頓上校的話也許並不全是危言聳聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當普通人拿起了武器，無論他們是自願還是非自願，我們面臨的都將是一場維多利亞許久未見的災難。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G3_victoria_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下午好啊西爾莎！這麼巧，我剛想去報社找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，西爾莎，你怎麼了？你剛哭過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"......簡妮。不，我沒事，我很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你騙人。你眼睛都腫了，而且臉色這麼蒼白，平時你可不會允許自己這麼狼狽地上街。你受到了驚嚇，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰欺負你了？還是上次那個士兵嗎？我再幫你想想辦法......一定會有辦法的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的，簡妮，你別瞎猜了。他並沒有再來纏著我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"是......我不知道怎麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，深呼吸——在你面前的人是我，你的好朋友。你現在很安全，我保證。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"簡妮......為什麼？為什麼你是他們中的一個？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼啊西爾莎？我不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想你受到傷害。你是我最好的朋友......而且你是一個好人。我也是好人吧？我的媽媽、爸爸、表弟......我們不都是好人嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的表弟......巴里？你是說達米安·巴里？對不起，是我沒反應過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"這不是你的錯。這也不該是我的錯。我只想要平靜的生活。我不想再看見重要的人死去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哭吧，西爾莎，我陪著你。看著親人離世，還要忙著工作，你壓力太大了。要不要靠在我的肩膀上？這樣能舒服一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，謝謝你，簡妮，看到你我已經好多了。現在我明白自己該怎麼做——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"這個給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......一個地址？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我還可以給你幾個人名。但沒這個必要，我不想把你捲進更大的危險裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"這個地址也該夠了。你可以......交給你覺得可靠的人。你的士官長，或者別的長官，比如路易士叔叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道有人在打聽達米安的事，他們想弄清楚我們在謀劃什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謀劃——西爾莎，連你都......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我不清楚。信不信由你，從頭到尾，我只是負責傳遞一些消息。幾張夾在書裡的便條紙，一兩句藏在小丘晚報雜事欄裡的暗號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前以為這是為了讓大家更安全......我並不瞭解他們在盤算這麼可怕的事，直到我剛才聽見總編的通訊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我不想辯解或者懺悔，更重要的是及時阻止他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我會的。我想好了這東西該給誰。比起其他人，她能更公正地對待你們。西爾莎，你別怕，一切都會好起來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，簡妮，我相信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西爾莎","speakerId":"avg_npc_213","isRemote":false,"text":"晚上八點，你要記得。拿好這個地址——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第十區雕像東側......左數第三個巷口。這裡有家書店，書店門口的花盆......黃色玫瑰......找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風......笛......收——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這樣壓在花盆底下就可以了嗎？剛好有塊鬆動的磚，和早上說的一模一樣。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這收信方式可真特別。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"簡妮","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（倫蒂尼姆來的朋友，希望你能幫到西爾莎......和我們所有人。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麥克馬丁兄弟員工","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，樓下有人新扔了一張紙條，在黃玫瑰下面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"拿過來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，黃玫瑰，給我的嗎？好快啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你跟我提過的線人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。也是駐軍士兵，不過隊長放心，她是個熱心腸的好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但願你慧眼識人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒問題！我眼光一向很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紙條上寫的什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“大壩街109號，今晚8點”——就這一句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"廚子麥克馬丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"大壩街？就在第十區和十一區交界處。這地方我有印象，是波頓男爵的房產。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來今天晚上會有一場重要的集會。風笛，我們該出發了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G9_rhodes_xqoffice"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......您在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。喝著熱茶，翻翻報紙，做我這個年紀的人該做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，風變大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"找到您想看的了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（塔拉語）當你想找明天時，你卻與昨日相見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"您會說塔拉語？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遠遠談不上會，如你所見，現學現賣而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......難以置信。奧利弗是對的，您非常厲害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，第一次讓人驚訝的時候我還會有些得意，第二第三次就難免無趣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"我們辦事處，大家基本都不會說塔拉語。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"考慮到你們的出身，這很合理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奧利弗成長於倫蒂尼姆北部的中產家庭，他們家族最早來自高盧，他至今住在辦事處樓上，每年都會請假回去看妻兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"弗雷德大約是來自半島郡的學徒，家中除了自己還有好幾個兄弟和一個小妹妹，家庭關係非常和睦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威爾是本地人，他們一家在幾十年前從附近的固定村落搬來小丘郡，他的塔拉血統應該是來自他的祖母。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......您看過我們的資料？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這麼怕麻煩的人，很少有提前做功課的習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"那您......怎麼知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"語言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姓名、口音、措辭、語氣，甚至停頓的偏好——語言中含有的資訊比你想像的要多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"我對薩科塔的特殊之處有所耳聞，但沒想到......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈，更多是我個人的小小興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"話說回來，對於其他人而言，語言也有特殊的意義——否則，塔拉人也不會如此執著於從故紙堆裡把自己的語言找回來了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"您說的對。在三五年前，並沒有多少塔拉人常說塔拉語。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......您大概也聽出來了，我不是塔拉人。我的妻子是，她生前只教過我一兩句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可如今這種漸漸消失的語言在報紙上到處都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，我剛才聽到窗外有人在教孩子們用塔拉語稱呼彼此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......您提起之前，我沒發現。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"語言的紐帶比許多別的東西都要牢固，不像血緣可能被流逝的時間沖淡，也不像利益時時刻刻都需要在天秤上經受衡量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看樣子，有人想要利用這根紐帶，令一個本來日漸鬆散的群體重聚。可這麼一來，舊有的集合將不再穩固。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞不會放任這件事在眼皮子底下發生。然而拉扯的力量越大，反彈的力量就越超出預期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們知道我因何而來，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......其實，沒那麼清楚。我只覺得，取資料不用勞煩一名精英幹員親自跑一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紙面資料不如親眼所見，這麼說的話，取資料也算不上幌子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩再告訴我一遍，這半年來，有多少家當地企業與我們中止了合作？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幹員碎紙機","speakerId":"avg_npc_089","isRemote":false,"text":"......七家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比上個月報告的還多了三家。在今天的維多利亞，任何風吹草動，大商人們的錢袋子都會最先察覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也得出門再多看幾眼了——趕在泥雨將這座城市淹沒之前。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G3_victoria_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，從上午到現在，你一直皺著眉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們剩下的時間不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一次鬼魂部隊的行動，和過去那些案件有所不同。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前他們行事隱蔽，速度很快。每次我們想追上去的時候，都會發現線索全部被處理乾淨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而現在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，他們就像織完毛衣扔了一地線頭？線頭和線頭之間還沒什麼關聯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......而且這些線索都斷在了小丘郡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，不光是你，我也感覺悶得慌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在這座城市，活像個出不了氣的高壓蒸鍋。居民，駐軍，大家都很煩躁，隨時隨地都有人在打架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......大家都在等，等第一道雷什麼時候落下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但要是真落下來了，這座城市......不，維多利亞會變成什麼樣子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（隊長......！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（有人跟蹤！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......確實。看到西邊那巷子了嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（明白。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G7_decisivebattlealley_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克雷格","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，怎麼回事？是一個小孩子......而且還有些眼熟？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克雷格","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚，痛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，抱歉！我這就鬆手。我本以為跟進來的會是什麼壞傢伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克雷格","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"......球。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是因為球掉了，所以想過來撿對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快點回家去吧，這地方不太安全，到處亂跑的話，你的爸爸媽媽會擔心的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長，虛驚一場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只是一個孩子？不，不太像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跟著我們的人不止一個，而且能跟著走了幾條街，都沒有被我們發現，他們本身具備一定跟蹤經驗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛才躲在高處，還有沒有看到什麼不同尋常的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"風笛","speakerId":"avg_222_bpipe_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......一定要說的話，我瞥見不遠處的街道上有一個特別亮的圓環......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"號角","speakerId":"avg_npc_229_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......薩科塔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G3_victoria_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請給我一塊蛋糕，還有這個蘋果派......那種餅乾也請給我來一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是艱難的選擇，畢竟華法琳禁止我吃太多甜點......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，請問這些糕點中，哪種最甜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦躁的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道你不知道？不會啊，你在小丘郡待了挺長時間了吧？我想，服役時間應該超過三年——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦躁的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......你？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別急啊，我能看出來，你跟著的人當然也能看出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正任務也沒法繼續了，不嘗嘗我買的蘋果派嗎？挺好吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦躁的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你這奇奇怪怪的薩科塔，究竟從哪裡冒出來的？為什麼要阻攔我們的行動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？沒攔啊，我只是路過而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦躁的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦躁的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"十二隊，目標丟了，但看她們消失的方向，應該是去大壩街。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦躁的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......好的，我明白，我馬上帶人去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦躁的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我們逐一排查。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦躁的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"我警告你，薩科塔，不該摻和的事情別摻和。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......警告？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"類似的話聽得實在太多，沒什麼武器抵著我，還真不習慣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦躁的青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"......我現在沒空聽你耍嘴皮子。士兵們，我們走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老闆，別害怕，士兵都走啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩把剩下這些甜品都包一包，我帶回去給同事們嘗嘗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Outcast","speakerId":"avg_npc_245_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......畢竟，是時候把出門辦事的小朋友們都叫回來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
